<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Apr 8.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Apr 8.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Milling wheat 11 pct protein to Apr 115.00 May 116.00</p>
<p>London Jul 116.00</p>
<p>Feed wheat Liverpool May 101.50/102.00 Jun 103.00</p>
<p>Avon Apr 99.00 May 100.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Oct/Dec 103.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Avon range Apr 100.50</p>
<p>Norfolk/Suffolk Apr 94.00 May 95.00</p>
